{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCodes\">Tax Codes</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Business Code On Rate Tax TaxCode TaxCodes TaxRate To ToDate Transaction Transactions\"><code>Tax Codes</code> define the tax rates that apply to your business transactions.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Code On Other Purchases Rate Sales Sent Tax TaxCode TaxRate To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Each tax code represents a specific tax rate or combination of rates that you can apply to sales, purchases, and other transactions.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-percent\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCodes\">Tax Codes</span></span></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Tax TaxCode TaxCodes\">Creating Tax Codes</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Create NewTaxCode On Tax TaxCode To ToDate\">To create a new tax code, click the <code>New Tax Code</code> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCodes\">Tax Codes</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewTaxCode\">New Tax Code</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Code On Rate Rent Tax TaxCode TaxRate To ToDate Transaction Transactions Type\">When setting up a tax code, you specify the tax rate and configure how it applies to different types of transactions.</p><p><span translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code LearnMore Tax TaxCode\">Learn more about tax code setup:</span> <a href=\"/guides/tax-code-form\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxCode\">Tax Code</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Edit\">Edit</span></a></p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Tax TaxCode TaxCodes\">Managing Tax Codes</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Code Is Name Tax TaxCode TaxCodes\">Tax codes appear in this list showing their name and usage.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Code Column On Tax TaxCode To ToDate Transaction Transactions View\">The <code>Transactions</code> column shows how many transactions use each tax code. Click the number to view all transactions for that specific tax code.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And Code HasWhere Invoice Invoices Is On Other Payment Payments PurchaseInvoice PurchaseInvoices Receipt Receipts Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices Tax TaxCode TaxCodes To ToDate Transaction TransactionType Type\">You can apply tax codes to sales invoices, purchase invoices, receipts, payments, and most other transaction types where tax is relevant.</p>",
  "key": "tax-codes"
}
